oming aware that the player is a minor post-registration.","notes":null},{"title":"*Record-keeping","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"Record-keeping","notes":"closed due to full license [Julienne Wilsoe - 07-08-2026 19:00]"},{"title":"Contacting the operator","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"Procedure on how the player can contact the operator regarding RG concerns via email or chat","notes":null},{"title":"Language","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":null},{"title":"*Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":"closed due to full license [Julienne Wilsoe - 07-08-2026 19:01]"},{"title":"*Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":"closed due to full license [Julienne Wilsoe - 07-08-2026 19:01]"},{"title":"*Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":"closed due to full license [Julienne Wilsoe - 07-08-2026 19:03]"},{"title":"*Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":"closed due to full license [Julienne Wilsoe - 07-08-2026 19:03]"},{"title":"*Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-03","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":"closed due to full license [Julienne Wilsoe - 07-08-2026 19:04]"},{"title":"*I